<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Students are automatically considered for our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/scholarships">New American University Scholarships</a> upon admission. An ACT or SAT score is required for merit-based scholarship consideration. We accept scores listed on your official transcript or sent directly from the testing centers using the ASU school codes 4007 for <a href="http://collegeboard.org">SAT</a> or 0088 for <a href="http://actstudent.org">ACT</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Use our <a href="http://scholarships.asu.edu/estimator">scholarship estimator</a> to see if you may be eligible for one of our merit-based scholarships. <a href="https://students.asu.edu/scholarships">View more information</a> on scholarships.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We don’t want you to miss out on this scholarship opportunity. Please let me know if you have any further questions. I am happy to assist you.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>